  "name": "rmcp-sdk",
  "description": "An official Rust implementation of the Model Context Protocol (MCP) providing a high-performance SDK for LLM-tool interoperability using the Tokio async runtime. It features a robust transport abstraction supporting stdio, SSE, and WebSockets, alongside procedural macros for streamlined tool and prompt definition. The project ensures compliance with the 2025-06-18 specification, including advanced elicitation flows and OAuth2-based authentication.",
